## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Likely cause | Fix |
|---------|----------------|-----|
| `LD_PRELOAD` shows `/sw/workload/...` | System sticky xalt loaded | `source load_local_xalt.sh` |
| No JSON files at all | Hostname SKIP in built config | Rebuild; verify KEEP for `dt-login` in `.lex` |
| Looking in wrong folder | Month bucket | Check `$XALT_FILE_PREFIX` or `log_repo/delta/json/YYYYMM/` |
| `Permission denied` on `/sw/workload/.../sitecustomize.py` | Production PYTHONPATH | Use `load_local_xalt.sh` |
| `libuuid.so: cannot open` | Missing symlink | Step 4 |
| `ModuleNotFoundError` | No venv / missing pip package | `source venv/bin/activate`; `pip install ...` |
| Too many `pkg.*` files | Stock XALT or filters not built in | Rebuild; confirm `sitecustomize.py` has `_is_direct_user_import` |

Enable XALT debug trace:

  export XALT_TRACING=yes
  python3 test3.py 2> /tmp/xalt_trace.txt
  grep -i hostname /tmp/xalt_trace.txt

